SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nIf you want
  to meet earlier than 9 AM (like 8 or 8:30) then please let me know by the
  day before. If you show up later than 9 AM and we have to rotate people i
 n then those who show up by 9 AM will have court priority. It all depends 
 on how many people we have vs. court space on any given day. Keep monitori
 ng the comments for any changes though keep in mind I typically don’t mo
 nitor comments after 9 AM.\n\n**RULES:** By signing up you agree to follow
  these rules:\n\n1\\. No instruction or orders are allowed on any of our g
 roup courts\\. If two or more people are in agreement then they’re welco
 me to exchange instructions so long as they relinquish their court positio
 ns and don’t disrupt active players\\. If anyone is instructing or order
 ing you and you’re not comfortable then please tell them or let me know\
 \. Everyone should feel free to play however they wish without being direc
 ted without agreement\\\, most especially beginners\\.\n\n2\\. No formal l
 ocked\\-team matches are allowed on any of our group\\-reserved courts\\. 
 If people are in agreement then they’re welcome to find another court no
 t in use by our group to play strict matches\\. If we need to rotate peopl
 e in and out due to lack of enough courts then we’ll use a structure I l
 earned for balanced clinic matches\\. This typically includes quick matche
 s to 5 points after which everyone rotates clockwise one position\\. This 
 keeps those waiting rotated back in often and also discourages “dream\\-
 team” scenarios trying to hold the court via wins\\.\n\n3\\. We are fore
 most beginner\\-friendly and not aggressively competitive or an instructio
 n\\-oriented group\\. A little light and friendly competition or giving a 
 quick tip so long as you’re not holding up the court is OK but please pa
 ce yourself against the person you’re hitting to \\(e\\.g\\. hit softer 
 to members that might not be as good or as aggressive as you\\)\\. Everyon
 e should be made to feel welcome and free regardless of skill level\\. Beg
 inners most especially should always feel comfortable here\\.\n\n4\\. Plea
 se make sure you’re signed up using a name that matches your Meetup name
 \\. New players should always check in with me so I can mark you down as h
 aving checked in\\. Anyone showing up without a Meetup RSVP will be asked 
 to do so before they can participate in the event\\. If you’re bringing 
 one guest that’s fine\\\, just make sure to mark them on your RSVP\\.\n\
 n5\\. If I feel you’re consistently not following the rules I have the r
 ight to ask you to relinquish your position on the court\\. Please don’t
  sign up and attend if you don’t agree to following any one rule here\\.
  We are largely democratic but I reserve the right to make any final calls
  if I deem it necessary for any reason\\\, such as breaking up and remixin
 g long\\-locked groups if we have more than one court\\.\n\n**EQUIPMENT:**
  Please bring your own racquet and water\, as we don’t provide those. I 
 always have some balls for at least one court\, but feel free to bring you
 r own in case we need to branch out over more than one court.\n\n**DISCLAI
 MER:** Courts are subject to availability and weather. If you make plans t
 o attend please be prepared to cancel or adjust our location as needed. Fu
 rthermore\, by attending you agree to be fully responsible for your own he
 alth and safety. Each person is responsible to take a break for rest and w
 ater at their own discretion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315550795/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260704T233439Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260704T233439Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
