SUMMARY:V for Volleyball Aug8th @Watchung 1-10pm & BBQ
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nI'm Mike an
 d my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then we'll kee
 p score. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where you must s
 erve to score! Games will be to 25. No kicking\, no using your head.\n\nWe
 'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nWe have our own Volleyball NET\,
  poles\, & ropes!\nThere's a fire pit so we cook & have a barbecue.\nBring
  some snacks\, food\, or drinks or ice to share.\nIf you have fun and woul
 d like to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball Ne
 w Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)\nht
 tps://maps.app.goo.gl/w8ZFJhe6s4GBLF24A
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315763324/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260720T171804Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260720T171804Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
