SUMMARY:Let’s Play Chess/Board Games!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\n**For the c
 hess players specifically:** I'm cross promoting this with another group e
 vent that's happening at the same time and place\, so feel free to jump in
  with them. Here's a link to their event: Checkout this Meetup with North 
 NJ Tournament Chess Masters In Training: [https://meetu.ps/e/PPr6D/1dLbRS/
 ](https://meetu.ps/e/PPr6D/1dLbRS/)\n\nWe will be meeting at Fort Nonsense
  Brewery in Randolph\, NJ! This establishment sells an assortment of small
  snack items and alcoholic beverages\, but personal food and drink can be 
 brought to the venue. If anyone joining this event would like to place an 
 order\, let us know\, we can pitch in.\n\n**For the more casual/social boa
 rd gamers\,** or folks not into chess\, I'll have a healthy variety of oth
 er light to mid weight board games with me that support upwards of 8 to 10
  players.\n\nSee you there!\n\nNOTE: If you are not attending the event\, 
 please change your RSVP accordingly!
