SUMMARY:Ice Skating Hang Out - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nJoin us for
  an hour or more of ice skating indoors at Montclair State Ice Arena\, 1 A
 rena Dr.\, Little Falls Township.\n\n[Public skating](https://msu.finnlyco
 nnect.com/schedule/260) is offered from 9 p.m. until 11 p.m. on Rocky Rink
 .\n\nNo experience is needed. Many figure out how to ice skate on the firs
 t few tries\, especially if you've roller skated before! There are ice sup
 port structures and of course the wall that you can use to hold yourself u
 p.\n\nThere's also an area immediately outside the rink to put your valuab
 les and chat when taking a break from the ice.\n\nIt's $20 for admission a
 nd $5 for skate rentals\, or what's $25 total. All you have to do is show 
 up. We'll meet inside at one of the tables and will be skating at Rocky Ri
 nk. Look for a growing group of people!\n\nJust another FYI. It gets somew
 hat chilly while on the ice\, so if you get cold easily\, I'd recommend br
 inging long pants and/or a coat.\n\nIf you don't have a car\, there are so
 me bus and train options to get you to Montclair State University througho
 ut the day. Definitely inquire if you're interested in learning more!\n\nQ
 uestions? Thoughts? Ideas? You can message me on Meetup\, or call/text me 
 at 201-234-9609. Feel free to drop a comment below too.\n\nHope you'll con
 sider attending our sixth ice skating event\, or joining us for a bowling\
 , volleyball\, tennis or other event -> www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowlin
 g-soccer-volleyball
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315607892/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260709T004005Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260709T004005Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
